{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17214290","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17214290","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1721429001:0":{"text":"Hi there, do you know the young lady who lives on the second floor of that building?","source_cn":"小朋友，你认识住在二楼那边的姐姐吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x938F0396FC8D6523","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1721429002:0":{"text":"Oh, you must be talking about Amy!","source_cn":"哦！您是说艾米姐姐吧？我知道！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x13615B096EF1848A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1721429003:0":{"text":"She comes to me for the paper every time there's news about Prince Orion! And she's always so beautiful!","source_cn":"只要报纸上刊载了王子殿下的消息，她一定会来买！每次来都...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEF78A4147A3109D3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1721429004:0":{"text":"Have you seen her around lately?","source_cn":"那最近呢？你见过她吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8DAE9ABD9B839DC8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1721429005:0":{"text":"I think... it was three or four days ago. She bought a paper that day, and after reading it, she ran off in tears.","source_cn":"大概……三四天前吧？那天她买了一份报纸，看完之后就哭着...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x72E7AADD340F15C5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1721429006:0":{"text":"Was it the one that featured <style=\"stress\">Prince Orion's assassination</style>?","source_cn":"是那份刊载了<style=stress>王子被暗杀</...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7C6284208A2ECE5E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1721429007:0":{"text":"Yes. I haven't seen her since. Is she okay?","source_cn":"嗯，之后就没见过她了。姐姐，艾米姐姐她……怎么了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x48A7DF925A018AA6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1721429008:0":{"text":"She's... fine. Thank you.","source_cn":"她……没事的，谢谢你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA6EDB64F4B74F8C4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:希琳娜":{"text":"Shira","source":"希琳娜","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:整理报纸的报童":{"text":"Newsboy","source":"整理报纸的报童","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:夏洛洛":{"text":"Charolo","source":"夏洛洛","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":9,"localized_text_count":8,"speaker_count":3}}